flowchart LR
  accTitle: Bank sync and reconciliation
  accDescr: Actual Budget reads two linked accounts through Enable Banking. I compare budget snapshots to check matched and new entries, then reconcile the booked balance separately from pending amounts.
  start["Start sync<br/>in Actual"] --> feed["Enable Banking<br/>Two linked accounts"]
  feed --> audit["Compare snapshots<br/>before / after sync"]
  audit --> existing["Match existing<br/>bank references"]
  audit --> added["Count new entries<br/>Check duplicates"]
  existing --> balance["Reconcile booked<br/>balance with bank"]
  added --> balance
  balance --> pending["Track pending<br/>items separately"]
